rity high → beta is veryhigh, alpha medium, so nothing matched! That explains it. And `+high` would show veryhigh and high items. Let me test that too.\n\nLet me verify: `devtodo -G -f 'all,/Test/'` and `devtodo -G -f '+high'` and `devtodo -G -f '-medium'`.",
