sistant"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\":\"cd /tmp/devtodo_test && echo \\\"--- -T generate TODO ---\\\" && devtodo -T && ls -la && echo \\\"--- EDITOR test ---\\\" && EDITOR=true timeout 3 devtodo -e 1; echo \\\"exit=$?\\\"\"}","name":"bash"},"id":"6372d5df-1fd4-4a9f-be1e-26f6a4d8cb61","type":"function"}]},{"content":"--- -T generate TODO ---\ntotal 24\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 walley walley  4096 Oct  2 10:38 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 86 root   root   12288 Oct  2 10:28 ..\n-rw-rw-r--  1 walley walley   139 Oct  2 10:28 .todo\n-rw-rw-r--  1 walley walley    85 Oct  2 10:38 TODO\n--- EDITOR test ---\nModify the text of the item you are editing.\nexit=0\n","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"6372d5df-1fd4-4a9f-be1e-26f6a4d8cb61"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\":\"cat /tmp/devtodo_test/TODO; echo \\\"====\\\"; EDITOR='sed -i s/local/LOCAL/' timeout 3 devtodo -e 1 -f all && devtodo -f all\"}","name":"bash"},"id":"d49b7772-4107-431e-b0d1-e585f123f4d7","type":"function"}]},{"content":"- local search target\n  (added Fri Oct  2 10:28:23 2026, incomplete, priority high)\n\n====\n\ntodo: error, couldn't find index '1'\n","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"d49b7772-4107-431e-b0d1-e585f123f4d7"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\":\"cd /tmp/devtodo_test && EDITOR='sed -i s/local/LOCAL/' timeout 3 devtodo -e 1 && devtodo -f all\"}","name":"bash"},"id":"b2108832-f920-4582-a674-f633b860202e","type":"function"}]},{"content":"Modify the text of the item you are editing.\n  1.\n","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"b2108832-f920-4582-a674-f633b860202e"},{"content":"Your previous reasoning (interrupted): Hmm, after editing with sed, the item shows as \"1.\" with empty text? That's weird. The sed edited the temp file replacing \"local\" with \"LOCAL\" but the result shows \"1.\" with no text. Hmm, maybe the editor file format is just the text body and sed -i worked,